<title>USA: Zaring Homes says court reverses verdict.</title>
<headline>Zaring Homes says court reverses verdict.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaring Homes Inc said Monday that an appeals court reversed a $250,000 jury verdict against it.</p>
<p>The lawsuit alleged that Zaring had a hostile work environment that subjected the plaintiff to sexual harassment.</p>
<p>The Sixth Circuit found that there was insufficient evidence to support a finding of a hostile work environment and reversed the plaintiff's award.</p>
</text>
